ght.\nLook—an Angel hurries toward us,\nand the sixth handmaiden returns\nfrom her service of the day.\nMake your actions and looks reverent\nso he may delight to speed us upward.\nRemember, this day will never dawn again.\"\nI was used to his warnings\nnever to waste time, so on this matter\nhe could not speak to me obscurely.\nThe beautiful being came toward us\nclothed in white, his face\nlike the trembling morning star.\nHe opened his arms and spread his wings.","startTime":141.44,"endTime":226.32,"words":[{"word":"It","start":141.521,"end":141.761},{"word":"showed","start":141.761,"end":142.041},{"word":"the","start":142.041,"end":142.161},{"word":"Assyrians","start":142.161,"end":142.961},{"word":"fleeing","start":142.961,"end":143.401},{"word":"in","start":143.401,"end":143.601},{"word":"rout","start":143.601,"end":144.041},{"word":"after","start":144.041,"end":144.241},{"word":"Holofernes","start":144.241,"end":145.001},{"word":"was","start":145.001,"end":145.201},{"word":"slain,","start":145.201,"end":145.921},{"word":"and","start":145.921,"end":146.041},{"word":"the","start":146.041,"end":146.161},{"word":"remnants","start":146.161,"end":146.681},{"word":"of","start":146.681,"end":146.801},{"word":"that","start":146.801,"end":147.041},{"word":"slaughter.","start":147.041,"end":148.081},{"word":"I","start":148.081,"end":148.281},{"word":"saw","start":148.281,"end":148.561},{"word":"Troy","start":148.561,"end":148.961},{"word":"there,","start":148.961,"end":149.521},{"word":"reduced","start":149.521,"end":149.961},{"word":"to","start":149.961,"end":150.161},{"word":"ash","start":150.161,"end":150.641},{"word":"and","start":150.641,"end":150.801},{"word":"ruins.","start":150.801,"end":151.841},{"word":"O","start":151.841,"end":152.321},{"word":"Ilion!","start":152.321,"end":153.361},{"word":"How","start":153.361,"end":153.761},{"word":"abject","start":153.761,"end":154.201},{"word":"and","start":154.201,"end":154.361},{"word":"debased","start":154.361,"end":1